# Thinking vault is a standing thesis source

`/home/xy/thinking` is Xiangming's Obsidian vault of robot-debug logs, failure/solution notes, experiment ideas, and thesis outlines. It is **project memory**, not optional background.

Named high-priority note (always consult when writing deployment or experiments): `/home/xy/thinking/Ros build.md` — IPC/PC launch, Experiment A, rosbag, Zenoh, time sync, solver/policy-lag logs.

## Cloud-discussion notes (小论文 / thesis narrative supplements)

Two vault notes capture Claude.ai cloud discussions. Use them for **problem narrative, design rationale, and chapter hooks** — not as a source of current facts.

| Role | Path |
|------|------|
| Broader ledger (coverage, chapter map, known contradictions) | `/home/xy/thinking/thesis/claude 云端讨论总结.md` |
| Finer failure/design detail (policy exhaustion chain, UR wording, Release/CppAD) | `/home/xy/thinking/thesis/OCS2 在 Hero 移动机械臂真机部署——调试记录与论文素材.md` |

**Authority (hard):** live `/home/xy/hero-ros2` (`task_hardware.info`, code, docs) and settled project memory (e.g. bridge-on-IPC only, Experiment A frozen config) win over any number, topology, or "current architecture" in these notes. The ledger's own §0 and §7 say the same. If unverifiable, leave a `\todo{}` / `// TODO verify` — do not invent from chat memory.

When the two cloud notes disagree in detail, prefer the finer OCS2 deployment note for that topic; still re-verify facts in the repo before writing.

Before drafting or editing any thesis/seminar text:

1. Follow the `load-hero-project` skill, including its **thinking-vault refresh**.
2. Run the mtime check against `.cursor/thinking-source-state.md`. If any `.md`/`.canvas` (except `.obsidian/`) is newer than `last_checked`, read those files and update the stamp. If writing Ch.3/4/5, also re-open `Ros build.md` when it changed or when the section is about launch/logging.
3. Use the notes for problems, mitigations, experiment intent, and narrative of what was hard. **Do not copy numbers, topologies, or "current architecture" from the vault** — verify those in `/home/xy/hero-ros2`.
4. Never modify files under `/home/xy/thinking`. Only update the stamp in this repo.

Skip the refresh only if this same session already reported the vault check (updated vs unchanged).
